exports[`the impression composer > fixture 1: leading, numbered differential with reasons, also, not yet explained 1`] = `
"Hypothermia, cause not yet known (primary; working; acute). For: temperature 32.5 °C and cool or mottled, cool peripheries.
Also this visit, co-existing: Diabetes, type not yet determined (working; on problem list).
Differential: 1. Sepsis (must not miss), likely [1 for, 0 against]. 2. Myxoedema coma (must not miss), possible.
Considered and unlikely: hypoglycaemia in a person with diabetes (glucose 5.8 mmol/L on arrival, no insulin taken).
Not yet explained: cold intolerance (3 days), tiredness (3 days), loss of appetite (2 days), capillary refill delayed, time 3 seconds, BP 110/73 and SpO₂ 95 %."
`;

exports[`the summary composer > fixture 1, composed 1`] = `"A 76-year-old man with diabetes, with an acute 3-day illness: hypothermia with bradycardia. He reports cold intolerance for 3 days, getting worse, tiredness for 3 days and loss of appetite for 2 days. On examination he is alert, with cool or mottled, cool peripheries and capillary refill delayed, time 3 seconds. Temperature 32.5 °C ↓, BP 110/73 ↓, SpO₂ 95 % ↓. NEWS2 5. Allergies: cephalosporins, uncoded."`;

exports[`the summary composer > fixtures 2 and 4, composed 1`] = `"A 58-year-old man, with an acute 2-hour illness. He reports chest pain for 2 hours. Red flags present: sweating and brought on by exertion. Pulse 104 ↑. Allergy status not recorded."`;

